example:
会话进 Redis，Nginx 只做被动摘除：

```java
@Configuration
@EnableRedisHttpSession
public class HttpSessionConfig {
}
```

```nginx
upstream order_app {
    server 10.0.1.11:8080 max_fails=2 fail_timeout=10s;
    server 10.0.1.12:8080 max_fails=2 fail_timeout=10s;
}
server {
    location /api/ {
        proxy_pass http://order_app;
        proxy_set_header Host $host;
        proxy_next_upstream error timeout http_502 http_503 http_504;
    }
}
```

`proxy_next_upstream` 这条没有把 500 列进去。先停 10.0.1.11 的进程，等访问日志不再出现它，再换包、加回，然后才动 10.0.1.12。
